      "side": 1,
      "message": "We used a different API for randomness in microdroid_manager, I think the other used systemrandom in the end but might be easier to use?\n\nhttp://cs/android/packages/modules/Virtualization/microdroid_manager/src/instance.rs;l\u003d171;rcl\u003da1a7fb1bc59e16f3bc5e3e120502b30ae13476a2",
