      "writtenOn": "2022-01-19T18:19:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As it\u0027s a data format, would some versioning be needed or is it safe to assume that unnecessary.",
      "revId": "80c4d9a1485bc878915820aae631ad3821639f66",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
